2
00:00:03,860 --> 00:00:05,040
Man, this is weird.
夥計，這很奇怪。

3
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:08,260
You ever realize Captain Crunch's eyebrows are actually on his hat?
你有沒有意識到嘎吱船長的眉毛實際上在他的帽子上？

4
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:09,520
That's what's weird?
這就是奇怪的事？

5
00:00:09,900 --> 00:00:12,860
Joey, the man's been captain of a cereal for the last 40 years.
喬伊，這個人在過去 40 年裡一直是一家麥片公司的隊長。

6
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:16,060
Voila!
瞧！

7
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:17,320
What?
什麼？

8
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:18,880
The spoon.
湯匙。

9
00:00:19,320 --> 00:00:20,760
You licked and you put?
你舔瞭然後放了？

10
00:00:23,180 --> 00:00:24,260
You licked and you put?
你舔瞭然後放了？

11
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:26,740
Yeah, so?
是啊，所以？

12
00:00:27,680 --> 00:00:28,940
Well, don't you see how gross that is?
好吧，你沒看到這有多噁心嗎？

13
00:00:28,940 --> 00:00:30,560
I mean, that's like you're using my toothbrush.
我的意思是，這就像你在使用我的牙刷一樣。

14
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:33,380
You used my toothbrush!
你用了我的牙刷！

15
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:38,380
Oh, that was only because I used the red one to unclog the drain.
哦，那隻是因為我用紅色的來疏通排水管。

16
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:41,680
Mine is the red one!
我的是紅色的！

17
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:44,060
Oh, God!
哦，上帝！

18
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:46,720
Can, open, worms, everywhere.
可以，開放，蠕蟲，無所不在。

19
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:53,200
Hey, why can't we use the same toothbrush, but we can use the same soap?
嘿，為什麼我們不能用一樣的牙刷，但我們可以用一樣的肥皂呢？

20
00:00:53,420 --> 00:00:54,520
Because soap is soap.
因為肥皂就是肥皂。

21
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:56,740
It's self-cleaning.
它具有自清潔功能。

22
00:00:58,100 --> 00:01:02,160
All right, well, next time you take a shower, think about the last thing I wash and the
好吧，下次你洗澡的時候，想想我最後洗的東西和

23
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:03,400
first thing you wash.
你洗的第一件事。

24
00:01:27,240 --> 00:01:28,920
Come on.
快點。

25
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:34,020
I'll be there for you.
我會在那等你。

26
00:01:36,220 --> 00:01:39,140
I'll be there for you.
我會在那等你。

27
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:41,320
I've been there before.
我以前去過那裡。

28
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:44,660
I'll be there for you.
我會在那等你。

29
00:01:44,820 --> 00:01:46,740
So therefore be true.
所以，所以要真實。

30
00:01:51,920 --> 00:01:52,760
Hey.
嘿。

31
00:01:53,240 --> 00:01:53,660
Hey.
嘿。

32
00:01:54,660 --> 00:01:56,520
Look at you fancy lads.
看看你們這些帥氣的小夥子。

33
00:01:56,700 --> 00:01:56,720
Here, I got something for you.
在這裡，我有東西給你。

34
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:58,880
What's the occasion?
什麼場合？

35
00:01:59,380 --> 00:02:01,260
Well, you know the guy on my show that's in a coma?
嗯，你認識我節目中那個昏迷的人嗎？

36
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,040
He's having a brunch.
他正在吃早午餐。

37
00:02:06,100 --> 00:02:07,600
Okay, ready when you are.
好的，準備好後就可以了。

38
00:02:07,980 --> 00:02:10,700
Oh, kiddo, I can't believe you guys are actually getting tattoos.
哦，孩子，我不敢相信你們真的在刺青。

39
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:13,560
Excuse me? You guys are getting tattoos?
打擾一下？你們都去刺青了嗎？

40
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:16,840
Yes, but you cannot tell Ross because I want to surprise him.
是的，但你不能告訴羅斯，因為我想給他一個驚喜。

41
00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:20,100
Wow, this is wild. What are you going to get?
哇，這太瘋狂了。你會得到什麼？

42
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:21,940
Um, I'm getting a lily.
嗯，我要買一朵百合。

43
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:25,580
For my mom, because her name is Lily.
對於我媽媽，因為她的名字叫莉莉。

44
00:02:27,440 --> 00:02:30,120
Wow, that's lucky. What if her name was Big Ugly Splotch?
哇，真幸運。如果她的名字叫大醜陋斑點怎麼辦？

45
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:33,660
So where are you getting it?
那你從哪裡得到它？

46
00:02:33,960 --> 00:02:34,820
I think on my shoulder.
我想在我的肩膀上。

47
00:02:35,740 --> 00:02:37,100
What? What's on your shoulder?
什麼？你肩膀上有什麼？

48
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:39,220
Um, a chip.
嗯，一塊晶片。

49
00:02:42,440 --> 00:02:44,160
I've got a big attitude problem.
我的態度有很大問題。

50
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,540
A tattoo. I'm getting a tattoo.
紋身。我要去刺青。

51
00:02:48,300 --> 00:02:50,840
A tattoo? Why? Why would you want to do that?
紋身？為什麼？為什麼要這麼做？

52
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:51,540
Hi.
你好。

53
00:02:53,040 --> 00:02:54,920
Well, hey, you don't think they're kind of cool?
嗯，嘿，你不覺得它們很酷嗎？

54
00:02:55,700 --> 00:02:57,140
No, sorry, I don't.
不，抱歉，我不知道。

55
00:02:57,600 --> 00:03:00,980
I mean, why would anyone pay someone to scar their body for life?
我的意思是，為什麼有人會花錢請人在自己的身體上留下終生的疤痕呢？

56
00:03:01,040 --> 00:03:02,680
And what if it doesn't come out right, Phoebs?
如果結果不正確怎麼辦，菲布斯？

57
00:03:02,740 --> 00:03:05,800
And it's like, I don't know, having a bad haircut all the time.
就像，我不知道，總是有一個糟糕的髮型。

58
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,560
Why is everyone staring at me?
為什麼每個人都盯著我看？

59
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:12,540
Ross, come sign this birthday card for Dad.
羅斯，來給爸爸在這張生日卡上簽名吧。

60
00:03:12,720 --> 00:03:13,660
Richard's going to be here any minute.
理查隨時都會到這裡。

61
00:03:13,760 --> 00:03:15,640
Ooh, Richard's going to the party too, huh?
哦，理查德也要去參加聚會，對吧？

62
00:03:15,860 --> 00:03:18,020
Well, he's my parents' best friend. He has to be there.
嗯，他是我父母最好的朋友。他必須在那裡。

63
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:21,180
So, is today the day you're going to tell them about you two?
那麼，今天是你要向他們講述你們兩個的日子嗎？

64
00:03:21,900 --> 00:03:24,840
Yeah. For my dad's birthday, I decided to give him a stroke.
是的。為了慶祝我父親的生日，我決定給他中風。

65
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:28,120
Well, I think you should tell them.
好吧，我想你應該告訴他們。

66
00:03:28,740 --> 00:03:31,180
No. I don't even know how serious he is about me.
不，我甚至不知道他對我有多認真。

67
00:03:31,340 --> 00:03:32,640
Until I do, I'm not telling him anything.
在我這樣做之前，我不會告訴他任何事情。

68
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:34,880
I don't know. I don't think Mom and Dad would mind.
我不知道。我想爸爸媽媽不會介意的。

69
00:03:35,520 --> 00:03:38,420
Remember when you were nine and Richard was 30, how Dad used to say,
還記得當你九歲、理查 30 歲的時候，爸爸常說：

70
00:03:38,820 --> 00:03:40,020
God, I hope they get together?
天哪，希望他們在一起嗎？

71
00:03:45,900 --> 00:03:46,420
Hello?
你好？

72
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:47,820
It's me. I'm in Elkhart.
這就是我。我在埃爾克哈特。

73
00:03:48,320 --> 00:03:49,580
Okay. Come on, Ross.
好的。來吧，羅斯。

74
00:03:49,580 --> 00:03:49,740
See you, guys.
再見，夥計們。

75
00:03:50,100 --> 00:03:50,620
See you, see you.
再見，再見。

76
00:03:52,500 --> 00:03:54,060
Oh, bye-you.
噢，再見。

77
00:03:54,300 --> 00:03:54,940
Bye-you.
再見，你。

78
00:04:13,140 --> 00:04:17,220
Okay, here we go. Here we go. Here we go. Here we go. Okay, wait. Wait, wait, wait.
好的，我們開始吧。開始了。開始了。開始了。好吧，等等。等等，等等，等等。

79
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:20,240
It's going to be fine.
一切都會好起來的。

80
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:22,520
How can you say that? Are you not nervous?
你怎麼能這麼說呢？你不緊張嗎？

81
00:04:22,840 --> 00:04:25,120
I'm terrified. This is just a very absorbent suit.
我很害怕。這只是一件吸水性很強的套裝。

82
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:27,720
All right. Shall we, Monica?
好的。我們可以嗎，莫妮卡？

83
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:32,500
Yes, yes. No, you know what? Ross, let's switch places. You get in the middle.
是的，是的。不，你知道嗎？羅斯，我們換個地方吧。你夾在中間。

84
00:04:34,100 --> 00:04:36,800
No, you know, unless this looks like we're trying to cover something up.
不，你知道，除非這看起來像是我們試圖掩蓋某些事情。

85
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:40,240
Monica, Monica, you could come in straddling him. They still wouldn't believe it.
莫妮卡，莫妮卡，你可以跨坐在他身上。他們還是不相信。

86
00:04:43,420 --> 00:04:44,240
We're here.
我們到了。

87
00:04:44,560 --> 00:04:45,940
Oh, hi, kid.
哦，嗨，孩子。

88
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:46,760
Oh, the children.
哦，孩子們。

89
00:04:46,760 --> 00:04:47,660
Hi, darling.
嗨，親愛的。

90
00:04:48,240 --> 00:04:49,400
Happy birthday, Dad.
生日快樂，爸爸。

91
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,300
Oh, thank you.
哦，謝謝。

92
00:04:50,500 --> 00:04:51,100
Hi, Mom.
嗨，媽媽。

93
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:52,160
Happy birthday.
生日快樂。

94
00:04:52,700 --> 00:04:55,280
So, you kids thanked Dr. Berg for the ride.
所以，你們孩子們感謝伯格醫生的搭車。

95
00:04:55,460 --> 00:04:58,500
Oh, actually, Mom, I think Monica thanked him for the both of us.
哦，實際上，媽媽，我想莫妮卡為我們倆感謝了他。

96
00:05:01,020 --> 00:05:03,080
So, you kids take the train in?
那麼，你們孩子坐火車來嗎？

97
00:05:03,380 --> 00:05:04,940
No, Richard Berg gave them a ride.
不，理查伯格載了他們一程。

98
00:05:06,040 --> 00:05:10,600
Speaking of whom, I hear he's got some 20-year-old twinkie in the city.
說到誰，我聽說他在城裡有個20歲的小夥子。

99
00:05:15,320 --> 00:05:16,280
Finger cramp.
手指抽筋。

100
00:05:16,420 --> 00:05:19,600
Oh, God. Sorry. Here, let me get that, Mom.
哦，上帝。對不起。來，媽媽，要我來拿一下。

101
00:05:21,700 --> 00:05:24,220
So, Richard's shopping in the junior section.
所以，理查德在初級區購物。

102
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,060
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

103
00:05:25,940 --> 00:05:26,940
Are we still on that?
我們還在這上面嗎？

104
00:05:27,560 --> 00:05:30,220
You just know she's got the IQ of a napkin.
你只知道她的智商和餐巾紙一樣高。

105
00:05:30,320 --> 00:05:30,840
Mm-hmm.
嗯嗯。

106
00:05:31,380 --> 00:05:32,940
She's probably not even very pretty.
她可能根本就不是很漂亮。

107
00:05:33,280 --> 00:05:36,400
Just young enough so that everything is still pointing up.
只是還年輕，一切都還朝好的方向發展。

108
00:05:45,280 --> 00:05:46,640
Can you believe this place?
你能相信這個地方嗎？

109
00:05:46,900 --> 00:05:48,480
I know. This is a great apartment.
我知道。這是一間很棒的公寓。

110
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:51,960
I was just in the bathroom, and there's mirrors on both sides of you.
我剛才在浴室裡，你的兩邊都是鏡子。

111
00:05:52,140 --> 00:05:54,560
So, when you're in there, it's like you're peeing with the Rockettes.
所以，當你在那裡時，就像你在和火箭女郎一起撒尿一樣。

112
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,420
Well, there's my fantasy come true.
嗯，我的幻想成真了。

113
00:05:58,800 --> 00:05:59,560
No, seriously.
不，說真的。

114
00:06:01,200 --> 00:06:01,600
Hey.
嘿。

115
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:04,520
Hey, we were just saying, great apartment, man.
嘿，我們只是說，很棒的公寓，夥計。

116
00:06:04,580 --> 00:06:05,640
Thanks. You want it?
謝謝。你想要嗎？

117
00:06:06,080 --> 00:06:06,260
Huh?
啊？

118
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:07,800
Yeah, I'm moving to a bigger place.
是的，我要搬到一個更大的地方了。

119
00:06:08,420 --> 00:06:10,060
You should definitely take this one.
你絕對應該拿下這個。

120
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:12,640
Yeah, can you see me in a place like this?
是啊，你能在這種地方看到我嗎？

121
00:06:13,140 --> 00:06:15,640
Why not? You hate park views and high ceilings?
為什麼不呢？您討厭公園景觀和高高的天花板嗎？

122
00:06:16,280 --> 00:06:17,460
Come on, I'll show you the kitchen.
來吧，我帶你去廚房。

123
00:06:19,900 --> 00:06:23,660
Oh, that's all right, fellas. I saw a kitchen this morning on TV.
哦，沒關係，夥計們。今天早上我在電視上看到了一個廚房。

124
00:06:24,100 --> 00:06:24,840
Stop talking.
別說話了。

125
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:25,380
Okay.
好的。

126
00:06:27,660 --> 00:06:28,900
Come on, tell us.
來吧，告訴我們。

127
00:06:29,020 --> 00:06:30,420
Yeah, is she really 20?
是啊，她真的20歲了嗎？

128
00:06:30,580 --> 00:06:32,400
I am not telling you guys anything.
我不會告訴你們任何事。

129
00:06:32,620 --> 00:06:35,440
Come on, Rich. It's my birthday. Let me live vicariously.
來吧，裡奇。今天是我的生日。讓我以替代的方式生活。

130
00:06:36,260 --> 00:06:37,520
Dad, you really don't want to do that.
爸爸，你真的不想這麼做。

131
00:06:37,900 --> 00:06:40,740
Yeah, what's a little midlife crisis between friends?
是啊，朋友之間的中年危機算什麼？

132
00:06:41,300 --> 00:06:42,360
Jack, would you let it go?
傑克，你願意放手嗎？

133
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:44,040
Look, I know what you're going through.
聽著，我知道你正在經歷什麼。

134
00:06:44,100 --> 00:06:46,120
When I turned 50, I got the Porsche.
當我 50 歲的時候，我買了一輛保時捷。

135
00:06:46,320 --> 00:06:48,180
You, you got your own little speedster.
你，你有自己的小快車。

136
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,980
Guys, seriously. It is not like that.
夥計們，說真的。事實並非如此。

137
00:06:52,140 --> 00:06:52,700
Tell you what.
告訴你什麼。

138
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:57,200
Maybe one of these weekends, you can borrow the car, and I could...
也許某個週末，你可以藉一輛車，我可以...

139
00:06:57,200 --> 00:06:59,020
Dad, I beg you not to finish that sentence.
爸爸，我求你不要把這句話說完。

140
00:06:59,900 --> 00:07:01,140
Come on, I'm kidding.
來吧，我開玩笑的。

141
00:07:01,900 --> 00:07:03,800
You know I'd never let him touch the Porsche.
你知道我永遠不會讓他碰保時捷。

142
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:12,840
Okay, Rich.
好吧，裡奇。

143
00:07:14,060 --> 00:07:15,160
Which, which lily?
哪個，哪個百合？

144
00:07:15,760 --> 00:07:17,160
This lily or that lily?
這朵百合還是那朵百合？

145
00:07:17,720 --> 00:07:18,960
I like this lily.
我喜歡這朵百合。

146
00:07:20,080 --> 00:07:21,560
It's more open, you know?
它更加開放，你知道嗎？

147
00:07:21,620 --> 00:07:24,300
And that's like my mom. She had a more open, giving spirit.
這就像我的媽媽。她有一種更開放、樂於奉獻的精神。

148
00:07:25,540 --> 00:07:27,000
Oh, foghorn leghorn!
哦，霧號來航！

149
00:07:29,060 --> 00:07:31,620
All right, blonde girl, you're in room two.
好吧，金髮女郎，你在二號房間。

150
00:07:32,060 --> 00:07:33,640
Not so blonde girl, you're with me.
不是那麼金髮的女孩，你和我在一起。

151
00:07:34,980 --> 00:07:35,940
Here we go.
開始了。

152
00:07:36,660 --> 00:07:36,980
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

153
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:38,480
You're not going?
你不去嗎？

154
00:07:39,520 --> 00:07:40,100
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

155
00:07:40,660 --> 00:07:42,840
What, is it, is this because of what Ross said?
什麼，難道，是因為羅斯那句話？

156
00:07:43,100 --> 00:07:43,580
No.
不。

157
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:46,520
Well, yeah, maybe.
嗯，是的，也許吧。

158
00:07:46,940 --> 00:07:48,120
I don't believe this.
我不相信這個。

159
00:07:48,380 --> 00:07:50,200
Is this how this relationship's gonna work?
這段關係就這樣運作嗎？

160
00:07:50,340 --> 00:07:51,380
Ross equals boss?
羅斯等於老闆？

161
00:07:51,660 --> 00:07:52,920
I mean...
我的意思是...

162
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:55,000
Come on, what is this, 1922?
來吧，這是什麼，1922年？

163
00:07:56,320 --> 00:07:57,120
What's 1922?
1922年是什麼時候？

